DESCRIPTION:In 2023\, Dave MacGregor and his partner Claire had a son\, Lui
 . The results of Lui's MRI found that he has scarring on his brain. There's
  lifelong implications for Lui. As treasured members of the Scottish comedy
  community – we want to do everything we can to help provide for Lui's ne
 eds\, now and in the future. Last year our sold-out gigs raised over £10\,
 000. This year we're doing it all over again.\nMore info: https://comedyatl
 as.app/comedy-atlas/event/benefit-gala-for-lui/
